            {
                "class": "project-text",
                "type": "span",
                "html": "In conjunction with <a href=\"https://pleasecallmechamp.com/project/elf-indy-nascar-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Please Call Me Champ Inc</a>, we created a design and motion piece celebrating Katherine Legge, bringing INDY 500 and NASCAR together through cinematic CG, bold typography, and race temetry-inspired graphics. Built around the idea of two cars and one driver, the film captures the speed, precision, and ambition of her racing story."
