            {
                "class": "project-text",
                "type": "span",
                "html": "PepsiCo is redefining the beverage experience with Pepsi Smart Cans, a futuristic, digital-first evolution of the classic drink. To bring this innovation to life, <a href=\"https://pleasecallmechamp.com/project/smart-cans-pepsi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Please Call Me Champ Inc</a> was tapped to craft the Boot Up & Power Down motion sequences for the Pepsi Digi Brand Portal - a dynamic, cylindrical interface where content rotates in full 360-degree motion.</br></br>I was brought on to animate the graphics that would appear throughout the boot-up and power-down sequences, and to create some procedural animations for when the can would go into sleep mode."
            },
